# The Deja vu page (the ARP button's seventh page, after Pluck 2): how often a pluck note is the one the loop heard last time round (0 new .. 100 locked),
# the loop's length (4, 8, 16, 32 notes), leaps (an octave away). What the acid's Mutate changes (all, notes, rhythm, accents) is SEL + Mutate
# on the Acid line page since 0.14.7 (it was this page's fourth knob).
seed 0
wait 3000
turn SELECT 16 100
expect view 16
expect par156 0
expect par157 2
spin K1 50
wait 100
expect par156 50
spin K2 -1
wait 100
expect par157 1
spin K3 20
wait 100
expect par158 20
shot dejavu.png
spin K1 100
spin K2 10
spin K4 -10
wait 100
expect par156 100
expect par157 3
expect par174 50
# the acid's Mutates: SEL + the Acid line page's fourth knob
turn SELECT -5 100
expect view 11
expect par159 0
press SEL
spin K4 2
release SEL
wait 100
expect par159 2
press SEL
spin K4 10
release SEL
wait 100
expect par159 3
